## 🎯 Usage Instructions

### 1. Set up the boilerplate template

Create a directory structure like this:

```bash
mkdir -p terragrunt-boilerplate/environments/dev/{vpc,s3}

# Save the boilerplate.yml file
# Save all the .tmpl files in their respective directories
```

### 2. Generate your project

```bash
# Interactive mode
boilerplate \
  --template-url ./terragrunt-boilerplate \
  --output-folder ./my-simple-infrastructure

# Non-interactive mode
boilerplate \
  --template-url ./terragrunt-boilerplate \
  --output-folder ./my-simple-infrastructure \
  --non-interactive \
  --var ProjectName="TestApp" \
  --var Environment="dev" \
  --var AWSRegion="us-west-2" \
  --var VPCCidr="10.0.0.0/16" \
  --var S3BucketPurpose="app-data" \
  --var TerraformStateS3Bucket="my-terraform-state-bucket-12345"
```

### 3. Deploy the infrastructure

```bash
cd my-simple-infrastructure
terragrunt run-all plan
terragrunt run-all apply
```

